<title>JAPAN: Bandai says to hold briefing on merger.</title>
<headline>Bandai says to hold briefing on merger.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bandai Co Ltd said on Monday that it would hold a news conference at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) on media reports regarding its planned merger with Sega Enterprises Ltd.  </p>
<p>&quot;Preparations for the merger are going forward steadily,&quot; Mikio Ishigami, a managing director of Bandai, told reporters, adding that the planned merger date had not changed.</p>
<p>The company would try to remove any uncertainty among its workers about the planned merger, he added.</p>
</text>
